{{ 'section-product-mega-nav.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

{%- comment -%}
  PDP-only mega nav replicating spreadshirt.de's real header navigation
  structure (Gestalten / Shoppen / B2B, each with a hover flyout of
  category tabs, some of which open a further level-2 flyout panel).
  Hardcoded per the user's request ("give exactly same and give #
  href") rather than driven by a Shopify menu, since this store has no
  equivalent multi-level menu set up yet — every link is a "#"
  placeholder until real destinations exist. Pure CSS :hover, no JS,
  matching the no-JS-dependency pattern of the other PDP-only header
  rows.
{%- endcomment -%}

